      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure why the old reader made these non-storage types? They\u0027re marked as `compatible with read/write operations (a storage or subpass data image)` and have a format attached to them so I think they _should_ be storage types.",
      "revId": "8bca71d14782ae29a45a593d21a3855d765b0330",
