      "writtenOn": "2025-05-22T14:08:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The old reader is looking at the uses. If the texture is never written then it uses a sampled image, which works fine.\n\nI think this new way is fine too. Although, given that it\u0027s never written we should probably be using a read-only texture instead of a read-write texture.\n\nAlso, the name of the test is `MultiSampledImageAccessTest`, is that just a mistake?",
      "parentUuid": "17fe3af5_18ad3205",
      "revId": "8bca71d14782ae29a45a593d21a3855d765b0330",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
