      "message": "It could be a mistake, the names come from the old tests, heh. I can rename it.\n\nI don\u0027t have analysis to determine if it\u0027s ever written to mark it as read-only. I wonder if that should be a separate transform, or something that texture tries to do automatically, separate transform feels  better, but maybe worse, heh",
